WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:12.719
President Lincoln also said at that time:
'America is the last best hope on earth.'

00:00:12.719 --> 00:00:15.009
Would he repeat that now?

00:00:15.009 --> 00:00:17.789
And would you repeat it?

00:00:17.789 --> 00:00:24.200
Lincoln spoke of the United States as the
last best hope on earth because the United States

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:35.050
was the last and only and first successful
democratic republic in the world.

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:44.700
Europe, in his time, in Lincoln's time, was
a continent in which democratic revolutions

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.329
had been suppressed.

00:00:46.329 --> 00:00:57.239
After the spring time of nations in the revolutions
of 1848 the United States stood alone.

00:00:57.239 --> 00:01:04.340
Then the Civil War presented a great task
and if the United States were to succeed,

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:11.200
it would be the last best hope as the example
of liberalism to the rest of the world.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:23.080
It was not an accident that it was the gift
of the French people to the United States,

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:27.460
the Statue of Liberty, that now stands in the
New York harbour.

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:38.470
It is a statue that was given to represent
the victory in the Civil War.

00:01:38.470 --> 00:01:48.040
That statue holds the Declaration of Independence
in one arm, which proclaims that all men are

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:50.320
created equal.

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:54.690
At its feet are the broken chains of slavery.

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:59.530
Also significantly and symbolically, the Statue
of Liberty does not face towards

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:02.740
the United States but towards Europe.

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:05.020
Even in the 19th century.

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:14.340
And now the United States also radiates out
to the rest of the world.

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:21.730
The most important thing about being the last
best hope is to be an example.

00:02:21.730 --> 00:02:27.120
And that means that the United States must
reform its own democracy, and that this is

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:28.750
an internal process.

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:40.030
And if it is to be the last best hope it requires
ourselves to create the American example.

